    "detailed_description": "Cargo 3 is a futuristic action game set in science-fiction horror world, which links the best features of the genre: unusual dynamics and thrilling high intensity of the gameplay. Our main goal was to create a unique, realistic and gloomy mood, build up tension and intensify fear, at the same time to provide players with a maximum of emotions and sensations. While producing the game, we also focused on giving the appearance of reality and authenticity, as well as ensuring a high degree of identification with a virtual hero. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/318690/extras/28acf42a8bb1b01a632bee0356ef08cc.avif?t=1447363189\" /></div><br><br>So if you are looking for thrills and gloomy worlds attract you and you like being scared, CARGO 3 is made for you. It is a blood-chilling game, which guarantees great entertainment and will also make your heart race. Of course, it is exclusively for adult players, as well as for those with strong nerves.<br><br>Mode Normal / Mode Nightvision<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/318690/extras/b4544957b69e6a8248e285d98608d247.avif?t=1447363189\" /></div><br><br>Mode Frenzy / Mode Shadow<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/318690/extras/6033ec3f4a7637d12d1a888d1c2b49c8.avif?t=1447363189\" /></div><br><br>Cargo 3 on Facebook<br><br>Cargo 3 on Youtube",
